Usage: cal [OPTION] [[MONTH] YEAR]

Display a calendar.
Display a calendar for the specified month or year. If no arguments are given, display the current month.

OPTIONS:
  -m, --monday   start week on Monday
      --help     display this help and exit
  -V, --version  output version information and exit

EXIT STATUS:
  0  if OK,
  1  if minor problems,
  2  if serious trouble.

WinuxCmd is a Windows implementation of GNU CoreUtils for Linux-Windows developers and AI coding assistants.
